do not cover semantically equivalent JSON strings with unicode, slash, or HTML-style escapes.\",\"suggestedRegressionTest\":\"Add a JSONLContent test with an escaped secret such as `{\\\"content\\\":\\\"AKIA\\\\u0059RWQG5EJLPZLBYNP\\\"}` and assert neither the raw escape sequence nor the decoded key remains.\",\"minimumFixScope\":\"redact/redact.go JSON replacement path plus JSONLContent regression coverage.\"},{\"title\":\"Generic JSON password fields with low-entropy values are not redacted outside DB-shaped objects\",\"category\":\"security\",\"severity\":\"medium\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"evidence\":[{\"path\":\"redact/redact.go\",\"startLine\":443,\"endLine\":448,\"symbol\":\"isCredentialJSONSecretKey\",\"quote\":\"return credentialContext && genericPasswordKeyRegex.MatchString(normalized)\"},{\"path\":\"redact/redact.go\",\"startLine\":664,\"endLine\":668,\"symbol\":\"collectJSONLReplacements\",\"quote\":\"if redacted == val && isCredentialJSONSecretKey(key, credentialContext) && hasNonPlaceholderPasswordValue(val) {\"},{\"path\":\"redact/redact_test.go\",\"startLine\":768,\"endLine\":794,\"symbol\":\"TestJSONLContent_StructuredCredentialFieldsRedacted\",\"quote\":\"`\\\"password\\\":\\\"REDACTED\\\"`\"}],\"reasoning\":\"For JSON string values, low-entropy secrets are only redacted by key when isCredentialJSONSecretKey returns true. DB-prefixed keys are always covered, but exact `password`, `passwd`, or `pwd` keys are only covered when the containing object also looks like a DB credential object with host and user fields. A common payload like `{\\\"password\\\":\\\"correct-horse\\\"}` has no host/user context, the value is too low-entropy for String(val), and the key check returns false, so the password remains in the redacted transcript.\",\"reproduction\":\"JSONLContent(`{\\\"password\\\":\\\"correct-horse\\\"}`) returns the password unchanged because `credentialContext` is false and `correct-horse` is not detected by entropy or vendor patterns.\",\"recommendation\":\"Treat exact JSON keys `password`, `passwd`, and `pwd` as credential secret keys regardless of DB object context, while still applying hasNonPlaceholderPasswordValue to avoid redacting placeholders.\",\"whyTestsDoNotAlreadyCoverThis\":\"The tests cover generic `password` only inside a DB-shaped object with host and user fields, and raw-text `password=...` preservation does not exercise structured JSON key handling.\",\"suggestedRegressionTest\":\"Add JSONLContent cases for `{\\\"password\\\":\\\"correct-horse\\\"}`, `{\\\"pwd\\\":\\\"correct-horse\\\"}`, and placeholder values such as `{\\\"password\\\":\\\"${PASSWORD}\\\"}`.\",\"minimumFixScope\":\"redact/redact.go key classification logic and JSONL credential-field tests.\"}],\"inspected\":{\"files\":[\"redact/custom.go\",\"redact/packs.go\",\"redact/pii.go\",\"redact/redact.go\",\"redact/betterleaks_env_test.go\",\"redact/custom_test.go\",\"redact/packs_test.go\",\"redact/pii_test.go\",\"redact/redact_bench_test.go\",\"redact/redact_test.go\"],\"symbols\":[\"ConfigureCustomRules\",\"detectCustomRules\",\"ParsePack\",\"LoadPacks\",\"ConfigurePII\",\"detectPII\",\"String\",\"JSONLContent\",\"applyJSONReplacements\",\"replaceKeyedJSONValue\",\"collectJSONLReplacements\",\"isCredentialJSONSecretKey\"],\"notes\":[\"Reviewed owned files and linked tests using the code-reviewer workflow.\",\"Did not execute go test: the read-only sandbox prevented Go from creating its temporary build work directory.\"]}}","completed_at":1779213440,"duration_ms":255584,"time_to_first_token_ms":41348}}
